cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Local Hopf Problem on S^2 x S^2"
abstract: >-
  Computer-assisted proof that metrics of positive sectional curvature on
  S^2 x S^2 converge in C^infinity to the product of round metrics, answering
  Bettiol's Local Hopf Problem I. Includes the proof, the article, and exact
  and ball-arithmetic verification code.
authors:
